        <p class="pex">Claim. I audited CDC's NNDSS Weekly Data (data.cdc.gov x9gk-5huc, every row for MMWR years 2022-2026). CDC says the counts are &quot;presented as published each week&quot;. Every percentage below is the later count above the week-52 provisional YTD. …</p>
