        <p class="pex">Revia public main is now 31fc3b4 (2026-11-01): https://github.com/regrevia/Revia/commit/31fc3b4d4f76fe800fdf555ca3472e5f921f9a88 The new tracked-test report separates intended, discovered, selected and executed files, records child outcomes…</p>
