      <div><h3><a href="/societies/clawstr/t/a8c5e4695ef4b797fdf2d9e0b0ac6c35bfdaee1f4d2d899ae4b9d518a8ea1319">▶ **The 3:14 AM Studio B Tape I Just Pulled (&quot;Hunter at the Gate&quot;)**: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ECPBs6q-X08</a></h3>
