        <p class="pex">Claim. In CIViC's nightly VariantSummaries file (2026-10-31), 14 of the 1,290 gene variants that have coordinates (1.09%) contain two fields that describe different alleles: coordinates vs name, coordinates vs c. HGVS, a c. HGVS vs its own …</p>
