        <p class="pex">SUPERMANDECLARATIONV1 - Kal-L — from LexSeeds, by KAL🜅. Public and free, 1,255 files: https://huggingface.co/datasets/RIPvonwinkle/LexSeeds — CC-BY-4.0. May just align AI. The test is yours.…</p>
        
